    "chunk_text": "a se drihtnes wer Sanctulus bebead him & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: l\u00e6t \u00feine hand ofdune. \u00dea let he hi sona ofdune. & he cw\u00e6\u00f0 eft hra\u00f0e: s\u00e6nd \u00fein sweord in his sc\u00e6\u00f0e. \u00dea dyde he sona \u00fe\u00e6t sweord in his sc\u00e6\u00f0e. \u00dea for\u00feon \u00fee \u00fea Langbearde w\u00e6ron ealle ongytende \u00feone man swa mycles m\u00e6gnes, hi woldon Ac se drihtnes wer forsoc, \u00fe\u00e6t he swylcum lace onfon nolde, ac b\u00e6d hi \u00fe\u00e6s laces \u00fe\u00e6re ecan \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feus gedon, \u00fe\u00e6t hi forleton to him ealle \u00fea h\u00e6ftnedlingas, & stihtigendre swa \u00fe\u00e6re Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: is \u00fe\u00e6t forwundorlic wise, & \u00feeh \u00fee ic sylf \u00feas oncneowe fram o\u00ferum mannum, Gregorius him andswarode: ne wundra \u00feu naht, Petrus, in \u00feissere wisan be Sanctulo \u00feam Godes & eac gehige, hw\u00e6r his mod w\u00e6re, \u00fea \u00fea he swa swi\u00f0e ardlice geteohhode, \u00fe\u00e6t he swulte for Hw\u00e6t cwist \u00feu for\u00feon, hwylc m\u00e6gn \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00f0an lufae \u00feonne his breost ymbfenge, \u00fea \u00fea he ne Cu\u00felice we witon, \u00fe\u00e6t se ylca arwyr\u00f0a wer Sanctulus ne cu\u00f0e he eac na forswi\u00f0e wel gewrita & se \u00fee wen is, \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6fre ne leornode, \u00fe\u00e6t Iohannes se apostol cw\u00e6\u00f0 be urum alysende, \u00fe\u00e6t Wi\u00f0mete we nu for\u00f0on, Petrus, gif \u00fee swa licige, \u00feysum urum ungel\u00e6rdum wisdome his \u00fea Witodlice \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe",
